Remove both. The component will decide its own layout using CSS, not props.

```tsx
function ExhibitionCard({ exhibition }: { exhibition: Exhibition }) {
  return (
    <article className="card">
      <img src={exhibition.image} alt="" />
      <div>
        <h3>{exhibition.title}</h3>
        <p className="card__summary">{exhibition.summary}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
