Write the default (narrow) layout as the base case, since container queries follow a mobile-first pattern just as media queries do:

```css
.card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }
.card__summary { display: none; }
```

Add the wide layout inside the query, keyed to the container rather than the viewport:

```css
